6.3 Letter of Chairman FST Making Suggestions to Reduce Pending Litigation

The worthy Chairman, Federal Service Tribunal vide his d.o letter dated 26th July,2019 (Copy not reproduced) has invited attention of Secretary Establishment Division to the following:—  Decisions on appeal are delayed for want of parawise comments from Ministries/Divisions;
 Government departments are not represented at appropriate higher  level;
 Implementation of judgments/Decisions is subjected to unreasonable delay by Ministries/Divisions.
